    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Convert your office documents into PDF's\n\n### This workflow automates converting office documents to a PDF.  \n* It watches a target folder to pick up new files.\n* When a new file is detected, it is sent to a specified API Service to convert the office document to a PDF.  \n\n### Current Working Conversions\n* (doc or docx) to PDF\n* (xls or xlsx) to PDF\n* (ppt or pptx) to PDF\n\n### Need Help?\nJoin the [Slack] discussion (https://join.slack.com/t/educationalvistas/signup)",
        "height": 369.11111213356367,
        "width": 612.3162249429614
      },
